{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00755","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 登歌 · 杜羔","name":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 登歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因心克孝，位震遗芬。\n宾天道茂，轸怀气分。\n发祗乃祀，咳叹如闻。\n二歌斯升，以咏德薰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜羔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}